{
"rules": [
{"id":"R01","tactic":"URGENSI","weight":2,"why":"Pesan menekan agar bertindak cepat. Penipu sering memakai ini supaya korban tidak sempat berpikir.","any_of":["\\bsegera\\b","sekarang juga","hari ini (terakhir|saja)","dalam 1x24 jam","\\bburuan\\b","\\bsesegera\\b","\\bs(?:e)?gra\\b","\\bsecepatnya\\b","\\bcepetan\\b"]},
{"id":"R02","tactic":"URGENSI","weight":2,"why":"Kuota atau slot yang disebut terbatas sering dipakai untuk memancing keputusan terburu-buru.","any_of":["kuota terbatas","(tinggal|sisa) \\d+ (slot|orang|kuota)"]},
{"id":"R03","tactic":"URGENSI","weight":1,"why":"Kalimat 'kesempatan langka' biasanya dipakai untuk membuat kita takut ketinggalan.","any_of":["jangan sampai terlewat","kesempatan langka","hanya hari ini"]},
{"id":"R04","tactic":"DATA RAHASIA","weight":5,"why":"Kode OTP bersifat rahasia. Pihak resmi biasanya tidak meminta OTP lewat chat atau telepon.","any_of":["(kirim|sebutkan|berikan|infokan|balas)\\w*[^.\\n]{0,25}(otp|kode verifikasi|kode 6 digit)"],"unless":["jangan\\s+(?:[\\w,]+\\s+){0,6}\\w*$","(?:tidak|tak)\\s+(?:pernah|akan)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,4}\\w*$"]},
{"id":"R05","tactic":"DATA RAHASIA","weight":5,"why":"PIN, password, dan CVV tidak seharusnya diminta oleh pihak lain.","any_of":["\\bpin\\b","password","\\bcvv\\b","kata sandi"],"also_requires":["kirim","berikan","sebutkan","konfirmasi","infokan"],"unless":["jangan\\s+(?:[\\w,]+\\s+){0,6}\\w*$","(?:tidak|tak)\\s+(?:pernah|akan)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,4}\\w*$"]},
{"id":"R06","tactic":"DATA RAHASIA","weight":3,"why":"Foto KTP atau KK bisa disalahgunakan untuk pinjaman atau pembuatan akun palsu.","any_of":["foto ktp","selfie[^.\\n]{0,15}ktp","(nomor|no\\.?) kk","kirim\\w*[^.\\n]{0,15}ktp"]},
{"id":"R07","tactic":"DATA RAHASIA","weight":3,"why":"Permintaan nomor rekening atau kartu untuk 'verifikasi' sering menjadi jalan membobol akun.","any_of":["nomor rekening","nomor kartu","no\\.? ?rek"],"also_requires":["verifikasi","data diri","data lengkap","nama lengkap"]},
{"id":"R08","tactic":"BIAYA DI MUKA","weight":4,"why":"Diminta membayar biaya dulu sebelum menerima sesuatu adalah pola yang sangat umum pada penipuan.","any_of":["biaya (administrasi|admin|pendaftaran|pencairan)","uang jaminan","biaya (?:asuransi|aktivasi|pengurusan|provisi|materai|denda|bea cukai)","dana pengurusan","cukup bayar"]},
{"id":"R09","tactic":"BIAYA DI MUKA","weight":3,"why":"Permintaan transfer di awal tanpa jaminan sering menjadi tanda penipuan.","any_of":["transfer dulu","bayar (di )?awal","dp dulu","(?:tolong|mohon|bisa|bantu)[^.\\n]{0,15}(?:kirim|transfer)(?:kan)?\\s+(?:uang|dana|saldo|pulsa)","(?:kirim|transfer)(?:kan)?\\s+(?:uang|dana)\\s+\\d"]},
{"id":"R10","tactic":"BIAYA DI MUKA","weight":4,"why":"Deposit agar akun bisa dibuka atau dana bisa ditarik sering muncul di investasi bodong.","any_of":["deposit[^.\\n]{0,25}(akun|withdraw|penarikan)","top ?up[^.\\n]{0,20}(withdraw|tarik|cair)","deposit[^.\\n]{0,40}(?:aktivasi|member|mendaftar|bergabung)","(?:biaya|bayar|deposit)[^.\\n]{0,25}aktivasi"]},
{"id":"R11","tactic":"BIAYA DI MUKA","weight":4,"why":"Hadiah asli biasanya tidak mengharuskan penerima membayar pajak atau ongkos kirim lebih dulu.","any_of":["pajak hadiah","biaya (pengiriman|ongkir) hadiah"]},
{"id":"R12","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":3,"why":"Kabar menang undian yang tidak pernah kita ikuti patut dicurigai.","any_of":["menang undian","selamat[,!]? anda (terpilih|menang)","pemenang giveaway","mendapat(?:kan)? hadiah","memenangkan hadiah","hadiah (?:mobil|motor|uang|umroh|umrah)","program undian","klaim hadiah","(?:anda|akun anda|nomor anda|kamu)\\s+terpilih\\s+(?:sebagai|untuk|menjadi)\\s+(?:pemenang|penerima|mendapat\\w*|menerima)","\\bpemenang\\b[^.\\n]{0,25}(?:hadiah|undian|giveaway|promo)","kesempatan\\s+memenangkan","hadiah[^.\\n]{0,25}menunggu\\s+(?:konfirmasi|anda|kamu|diklaim)","mendapat(?:kan)?\\s+(?:bonus|saldo|reward|voucher|poin)"]},
{"id":"R13","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":4,"why":"Untung pasti atau bebas risiko hampir tidak pernah nyata. Setiap investasi punya risiko.","any_of":["untung pasti","profit harian","bebas risiko","modal kecil[^.\\n]{0,15}(hasil|untung|cuan) besar","cuan (pasti|harian)","untung\\s+\\d+\\s?%\\s+per\\s+(?:hari|minggu|bulan)","(?:untung|profit|keuntungan)[^.\\n]{0,25}(?:dijamin|pasti)","member lama[^.\\n]{0,30}menarik"]},
{"id":"R14","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":3,"why":"Gaji besar tanpa syarat jelas sering dipakai pada lowongan kerja palsu.","any_of":["tanpa pengalaman","kerja santai","gaji (jutaan|belasan juta|puluhan juta)","kerja dari hp","(?:gaji|dapat|bayaran|komisi|penghasilan)[^.\\n]{0,15}\\d+[.,]?\\d*\\s?(?:ribu|rb|juta|jt)\\b[^.\\n]{0,12}(?:per|tiap)\\s?(?:hari|minggu|tugas|jam)","(?:komisi|bayaran|upah|fee)[^.\\n]{0,15}rp\\.?\\s?\\d[\\d.,]*\\s*(?:per|tiap|/)\\s?(?:tugas|hari|jam|klik|like|video|task)"]},
{"id":"R15","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":2,"why":"Bonus atau saldo gratis yang disertai tautan sering mengarah ke situs tiruan.","any_of":["bonus","cashback","saldo gratis"],"also_requires":["https?://","klik","\\bwww\\."]},
{"id":"R16","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":3,"why":"Pinjaman langsung cair tanpa pengecekan sering dipakai pinjol ilegal.","any_of":["tanpa (bi checking|slik|survei|jaminan)","pinjaman[^.\\n]{0,20}langsung cair","dana cair (hari ini|cepat)","modal usaha[^.\\n]{0,40}tanpa (?:agunan|jaminan)","tanpa agunan"]},
{"id":"R17","tactic":"RASA TAKUT","weight":3,"why":"Ancaman blokir akun dipakai agar kita panik dan menuruti perintah.","any_of":["akun[^.\\n]{0,15}(diblokir|dibekukan|ditutup|dinonaktifkan)","diblokir permanen","(?:akun|kartu|rekening|nomor|layanan|kepesertaan)[^.\\n]{0,25}(?:akan )?(?:diblokir|dibekukan|ditutup|dinonaktifkan|dicabut)","menghindari\\s+(?:pemblokiran|penutupan|pembekuan|penonaktifan)","jika\\s+tidak\\s+(?:melakukan\\s+)?(?:verifikasi|konfirmasi|pembaruan)"]},
{"id":"R18","tactic":"RASA TAKUT","weight":3,"why":"Ancaman hukum lewat chat adalah cara menekan korban.","any_of":["dilaporkan ke (polisi|pihak berwajib)","somasi","tindak pidana"]},
{"id":"R19","tactic":"RASA TAKUT","weight":5,"why":"Ancaman menyebarkan data atau foto adalah pemerasan. Jangan ikuti permintaannya dan simpan buktinya.","any_of":["(sebar|menyebarkan|sebarkan)[^.\\n]{0,25}(foto|data|video)","hubungi (seluruh|semua) kontak","(?:foto|data|video|rekaman|chat)[^.\\n]{0,40}(?:disebar\\w*|(?:kami|saya|aku)\\s+sebar\\w*|dibocorkan|dipublikasi\\w*|diviralkan)","(?:semua|seluruh)\\s+kontak","\\bmengetahui\\s+data\\s+(?:pribadi\\s+)?(?:anda|kamu)\\b"],"unless":["(?:waspada|modus|penipu\\w*|korban|pelaku|mengancam)\\s+(?:[\\w:,]+\\s+){0,5}\\w*$"]},
{"id":"R20","tactic":"RASA TAKUT","weight":3,"why":"Kabar transaksi mencurigakan yang meminta kita klik atau menghubungi nomor tertentu sering menjadi jebakan.","any_of":["transaksi mencurigakan","(?:aktivitas|login)\\s+(?:yang\\s+)?mencurigakan","(?:transaksi|pembayaran)[^.\\n]{0,25}(?:bermasalah|tidak wajar|ditolak|ditangguhkan)"],"also_requires":["https?://","hubungi","telepon","klik","balas"]},
{"id":"R21","tactic":"OTORITAS PALSU","weight":3,"why":"Mengaku dari lembaga resmi lewat chat pribadi. Cek lewat kontak resmi yang kita cari sendiri.","any_of":["pihak bank","customer service","petugas (ojk|kominfo|komdigi)","kepolisian"],"unless":["termasuk\\s*$","(?:jangan|waspada)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,3}\\w*$"],"unless_after":["^\\s*(?:tidak|tak)\\s+(?:pernah|akan)"]},
{"id":"R22","tactic":"OTORITAS PALSU","weight":3,"why":"Rekrutmen resmi biasanya memakai email perusahaan, bukan hanya chat pribadi atau email gratis.","any_of":["hrd","rekrut(er|men)","recruitment"],"also_requires":["@gmail\\.com","@yahoo","wa\\.me","whatsapp","hubungi wa"]},
{"id":"R23","tactic":"OTORITAS PALSU","weight":4,"why":"File APK atau tautan berkedok undangan, resi, atau tagihan sering membawa aplikasi berbahaya.","any_of":["\\.apk\\b","(undangan|resi paket|surat tilang|tagihan)[^.\\n]{0,40}(https?://|\\.apk|klik)"]},
{"id":"R24","tactic":"ISOLASI","weight":4,"why":"Diminta merahasiakan sesuatu adalah cara penipu menjauhkan kita dari orang yang bisa menyadarkan.","any_of":["jangan bilang (ke )?siapa[- ]?siapa","rahasiakan (ini|hal ini|percakapan|obrolan|transaksi)","hanya untuk kamu"]},
{"id":"R25","tactic":"KEDEKATAN PALSU","weight":3,"why":"Pesan dari 'teman' dengan nomor baru yang meminta uang perlu dikonfirmasi lewat telepon atau kanal lain.","any_of":["ini aku,? (nomor|no) baru","ini (nomor|no)\\.? baru","pinjam dulu","tolong transfer dulu"]},
{"id":"R26","tactic":"ISOLASI","weight":2,"why":"Dipindah ke aplikasi lain untuk wawancara atau tugas bisa jadi cara menghindari pengawasan platform.","any_of":["telegram","pindah ke wa"],"also_requires":["wawancara","tugas","interview"]},
{"id":"R27","tactic":"TAUTAN MENCURIGAKAN","weight":2,"why":"Tautan yang dipendekkan atau berisi banyak tanda hubung menyembunyikan tujuan sebenarnya.","any_of":["https?://(bit\\.ly|tinyurl\\.com|cutt\\.ly|s\\.id|t\\.ly|is\\.gd|rb\\.gy|shorturl\\.at|ow\\.ly|ln\\.run|lnkl\\.st|rebrand\\.ly|v\\.gd|clck\\.ru|bitly\\.ws|shorturl\\.gg|bitly\\.com|wa\\.link|bit\\.do|tiny\\.cc|soo\\.gd|kutt\\.it|adf\\.ly|buff\\.ly|shorturl\\.asia|qrco\\.de|urlz\\.fr|tr\\.ee|wde\\.la)\\S*","https?://[^\\s/]*-[^\\s/]*-[^\\s/]*-[^\\s/]*","\\b(?:bit\\.ly|tinyurl\\.com|cutt\\.ly|s\\.id|t\\.ly|is\\.gd|rb\\.gy|shorturl\\.at|ow\\.ly|ln\\.run|lnkl\\.st|rebrand\\.ly|v\\.gd|clck\\.ru|bitly\\.ws|shorturl\\.gg|bitly\\.com|wa\\.link|bit\\.do|tiny\\.cc|soo\\.gd|kutt\\.it|adf\\.ly|buff\\.ly|shorturl\\.asia|qrco\\.de|urlz\\.fr|tr\\.ee|wde\\.la)/\\S+"]},
{"id":"R28","tactic":"TAUTAN MENCURIGAKAN","weight":3,"why":"Nama merek yang dipasang di domain tidak resmi atau domain murah sering dipakai situs tiruan.","any_of":["https?://[^\\s/]*(bca|bri|bni|mandiri|dana|ovo|gopay|shopee|tokopedia|jne|jnt|bpjs)[^\\s/]*\\.(xyz|top|click|icu|site|online|vip|cc)\\b","https?://[^\\s/]*\\.(xyz|top|click|icu|buzz|cfd|sbs|monster|invalid)\\b","https?://\\d{1,3}(\\.\\d{1,3}){3}"]},
{"id":"R29","tactic":"OTORITAS PALSU","weight":3,"why":"Mengaku kurir atau paket yang disertai tautan, file aplikasi, atau permintaan biaya adalah modus yang sangat umum. Cek lewat aplikasi marketplace atau ekspedisi resmi, bukan lewat tautan di pesan.","any_of":["\\bkurir\\b","\\bpaket\\s+(?:anda|kamu|atas nama)\\b","\\bekspedisi\\b"],"also_requires":["https?://","\\bklik\\b","\\bwww\\.","\\.apk\\b","\\bbiaya\\b","\\bbayar\\b","\\btransfer\\b","\\bcod\\b"],"unless":["termasuk\\s*$","(?:jangan|waspada)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,3}\\w*$"],"unless_after":["^\\s*(?:tidak|tak)\\s+(?:pernah|akan)"]},
{"id":"R30","tactic":"KEDEKATAN PALSU","weight":4,"why":"Minta uang 'salah transfer' dikembalikan adalah modus yang sering dipakai penipu. Cek mutasi rekeningmu sendiri dan hubungi bank sebelum mengirim apa pun.","any_of":["\\bsalah\\s+(?:kirim|transfer|tf|masuk)\\b[^.\\n]{0,50}\\b(?:kembalikan|balikin|dikembalikan|tolong|mohon|kirim\\s+balik|transfer\\s+balik)\\b","\\b(?:uang|dana|saldo)\\s+(?:saya|aku|ku)\\s+(?:salah|nyasar)\\b"]},
{"id":"R31","tactic":"KEDEKATAN PALSU","weight":3,"why":"Mengaku keluarga atau teman yang ganti nomor lalu meminta uang atau pulsa adalah modus umum. Konfirmasi lewat telepon ke nomor lama yang kamu simpan.","any_of":["\\b(?:hp|ponsel|handphone|nomor)\\s+(?:aku|saya|ku|lama|mama|papa|ayah|ibu)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,2}(?:rusak|hilang|dicuri|mati|error|diretas|tidak aktif|ga aktif|gak aktif)\\b","\\bgan?ti\\s+nomor\\b","\\bsimpan\\s+nomor\\s+(?:ini|baru)\\b","\\bnomor\\s+(?:aku|saya|ku)\\s+(?:yang\\s+)?baru\\b"],"also_requires":["transfer","uang","pulsa","pinjam","pinjem","bayar","dana","rekening","saldo","talang"]},
{"id":"R32","tactic":"DATA RAHASIA","weight":5,"why":"Diminta meneruskan kode yang baru masuk ke ponselmu, sering dengan alasan 'salah kirim'. Itu cara mengambil alih akun WhatsApp atau akun lain. Jangan berikan kode apa pun.","any_of":["\\bkode\\s+(?:verifikasi|otp|6\\s*digit|enam\\s*digit|whatsapp|wa)\\b[^.\\n]{0,50}\\b(?:salah\\s+(?:kirim|masuk|nomor|ke)|nyasar|tidak\\s+sengaja|keliru)\\b","(?:tolong|mohon|bisa|minta)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,2}(?:teruskan|forward|kirim\\w*|sebut\\w*|berikan|infokan)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,2}(?:otp|kode\\s+(?:verifikasi|otp|sms|wa|whatsapp|6\\s*digit|yang\\s+(?:masuk|dikirim|baru|tadi)))","\\b(?:konfirmasi|konfirmasikan|infokan|teruskan|forward)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,2}(?:otp|kode\\s+(?:otp|verifikasi))\\b"],"unless":["jangan\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,2}\\w*$","(?:tidak|tak)\\s+(?:pernah|akan)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,4}\\w*$"]},
{"id":"R33","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":3,"why":"Tugas 'like', 'subscribe', atau 'review' dengan komisi per tugas adalah pola penipuan kerja online. Awalnya dibayar kecil, lalu korban diminta menyetor modal.","any_of":["\\b(?:like|subscribe|follow|review|rating|rate)\\b[^.\\n]{0,40}\\b(?:komisi|bayaran|dibayar|upah|fee|\\d+\\s?(?:rb|ribu|k)\\b)","\\btugas\\s+(?:harian|ringan|mudah|online|sederhana)\\b","\\bkomisi\\b[^.\\n]{0,25}\\b(?:per|tiap|setiap)\\b","\\bkerja\\s+(?:online|sampingan|paruh waktu|part\\s*time)\\b[^.\\n]{0,40}\\b(?:gaji|komisi|bayaran|\\d+\\s?(?:rb|ribu|jt|juta|k)\\b)"]},
{"id":"R34","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":3,"why":"Robot trading, grup sinyal, atau persentase untung yang disebut pasti adalah ciri investasi bodong. Cek izin lewat OJK sebelum menyetor uang.","any_of":["\\b(?:robot|bot|ea)\\s+(?:trading|forex)\\b","\\b(?:grup|group|channel|komunitas)\\s+(?:vip\\s+)?(?:saham|crypto|kripto|trading|forex|investasi|sinyal)\\b","\\b(?:sinyal|signal)\\s+(?:trading|forex|saham|crypto|kripto)\\b","\\bprofit\\s+\\d+\\s?%","\\b(?:cuan|untung|profit|keuntungan|bagi hasil)\\s+\\d+\\s?(?:%|persen)\\b","\\binvestasi\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,2}(?:aman|pasti|terjamin|tanpa risiko)\\b","\\bgandakan\\s+(?:uang|dana|modal|saldo|investasi)\\b"]},
{"id":"R35","tactic":"RASA TAKUT","weight":4,"why":"Dikaitkan dengan kasus narkoba, pencucian uang, atau pidana lain lewat chat atau telepon adalah cara menekan korban. Penegak hukum tidak menyelesaikan perkara lewat pesan atau transfer.","any_of":["\\b(?:narkoba|narkotika|pencucian uang|money laundering|terorisme)\\b[^.\\n]{0,50}\\b(?:atas nama|rekening|paket|terkait|terlibat|nomor anda|identitas anda|data anda)\\b","\\bterlibat\\s+(?:dalam\\s+)?(?:kasus|tindak|perkara)\\b","\\bsurat\\s+(?:penangkapan|panggilan|perintah penahanan)\\b","\\b(?:rekening|nomor|identitas|data)\\s+(?:anda|kamu)\\s+(?:digunakan|dipakai|disalahgunakan)\\s+(?:untuk\\s+)?(?:\\w+\\s+){0,3}(?:kejahatan|pidana|pencucian|narkoba|penipuan)\\b"],"unless":["(?:jangan|waspada)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,3}\\w*$"]},
{"id":"R36","tactic":"OTORITAS PALSU","weight":3,"why":"Tagihan, tilang, atau pembaruan data pemerintah yang meminta kamu klik tautan sering jadi jebakan. Cek lewat aplikasi atau situs resmi yang kamu ketik sendiri.","any_of":["\\b(?:e-?tilang|etilang|tilang)\\b","\\b(?:tagihan|tunggakan|iuran|denda)\\s+(?:listrik|pln|bpjs|pajak|pdam|pbb|kendaraan|samsat|paylater|spaylater|kredivo|akulaku)\\b","\\b(?:pembaruan|pemutakhiran|update)\\s+data\\s+(?:bpjs|kependudukan|dukcapil|ktp|kk|nik|pajak|npwp|coretax)\\b","\\bcoretax\\b"],"also_requires":["https?://","\\bklik\\b","\\blink\\b","\\.apk\\b","\\bwww\\.","\\b[a-z0-9-]+\\.[a-z]{2,}/\\S"]},
{"id":"R37","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":3,"why":"Kabar pencairan bansos atau bantuan pemerintah yang meminta klik tautan atau mengirim data adalah modus umum. Cek lewat situs atau aplikasi resmi kementerian terkait.","any_of":["\\b(?:bansos|bantuan\\s+sosial|blt|pkh|bpnt|kip|prakerja|subsidi)\\b[^.\\n]{0,40}\\b(?:cair|pencairan|tahap|daftar|pendaftaran|penerima|verifikasi|dana)\\b","\\b(?:pencairan|penerima)\\s+(?:bansos|blt|pkh|bpnt|kip|prakerja)\\b"],"also_requires":["https?://","\\bklik\\b","\\blink\\b","\\bwww\\.","\\b[a-z0-9-]+\\.[a-z]{2,}/\\S","\\bwhatsapp\\b","\\btransfer\\b","\\bbiaya\\b","\\bnik\\b"]},
{"id":"R38","tactic":"OTORITAS PALSU","weight":4,"why":"Pemberitahuan perubahan tarif atau 'upgrade nasabah' yang meminta persetujuan lewat pesan adalah modus mengambil alih rekening. Bank resmi tidak meminta persetujuan lewat chat.","any_of":["\\bperubahan\\s+(?:tarif|biaya)\\b","\\b(?:tarif|biaya)\\s+(?:transfer|admin\\w*)\\s+(?:baru|naik|berubah)\\b","\\bkategori\\s+nasabah\\b","\\b(?:upgrade|beralih)\\s+(?:ke\\s+)?(?:nasabah|akun)\\s+(?:premium|prioritas|vip)\\b"],"also_requires":["balas","setuju","konfirmasi","klik","link","https?://","hubungi","formulir","whatsapp"]},
{"id":"E01","tactic":"URGENSI","weight":2,"why":"Pesan (berbahasa Inggris) menekan agar bertindak cepat. Penipu sering memakai ini supaya korban tidak sempat berpikir.","any_of":["\\b(?:act now|immediately|right away|urgent(?:ly)?|within (?:24|48) hours|expires? (?:today|tonight|soon)|last chance|final notice|before it'?s too late)\\b"]},
{"id":"E02","tactic":"URGENSI","weight":2,"why":"Slot atau kuota yang disebut terbatas sering dipakai untuk memancing keputusan terburu-buru.","any_of":["\\b(?:limited (?:time|offer|slots?|spots?)|only \\d+ (?:slots?|spots?|places?|left)|hurry)\\b"]},
{"id":"E03","tactic":"DATA RAHASIA","weight":5,"why":"Kode OTP atau kode verifikasi bersifat rahasia. Pihak resmi biasanya tidak memintanya lewat chat atau telepon.","any_of":["(?:send|share|give|provide|tell|reply with|forward|read out|confirm)\\w*[^.\\n]{0,30}\\b(?:otp|one[- ]time (?:password|passcode|code|pin)|verification code|security code|authentication code|6[- ]digit code)"],"unless":["(?:do not|don'?t|never|won'?t|will not|would not|should not|shouldn'?t|cannot|can'?t)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,5}\\w*$"]},
{"id":"E04","tactic":"DATA RAHASIA","weight":5,"why":"Kata sandi, PIN, CVV, atau frasa pemulihan dompet tidak seharusnya diminta oleh pihak lain.","any_of":["(?:send|share|give|provide|tell|reply with|read out|text me)\\w*[^.\\n]{0,25}\\b(?:password|passcode|pin|cvv|seed phrase|recovery phrase|private key)\\b","(?:send|share|give|provide|tell|reply with|read out|text me)\\w*[^.\\n]{0,25}\\b(?:(?:bank|online banking|account) (?:login|credentials|password)|login (?:details|credentials))\\b"],"unless":["(?:do not|don'?t|never|won'?t|will not|would not|should not|shouldn'?t|cannot|can'?t)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,5}\\w*$"]},
