{"id":"J11","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":2,"why":"Ajakan 'daftar dan main' atau 'join sekarang' dengan nada heboh khas pesan promosi massal.","any_of":["\\bnikmati\\W+(?:ke)?seru","\\bjoin\\s+(?:langsung|sekarang)","\\bburuan\\s+(?:join|daftar|dftr|gabung)","\\bd(?:a)?ftr\\b","\\bdp ?(?:&|dan) ?klaim","\\b(?:rasakan|nikmati)\\s+sensasi","\\bsitus\\s+(?:terbesar|terpercaya|resmi|terbaik)\\b[^.\\n]{0,12}\\b(?:indo|indonesia)\\b","\\b(?:gas|ayo|yuk|siap)[^.\\n]{0,15}\\b(?:dftr|daftar|join|gabung|main|mn)\\b","\\btunggu apa lagi\\b","\\blangsung\\s+(?:daftar|join|gas|klaim)\\b","\\b(?:jalur|akun|id)\\s+(?:anak\\s+baru|new\\s*member|member\\s+baru)\\b"],"squeeze":["langsung(?:k[il]k|[il]ink)","join[il]?langsung"]},
{"id":"J12","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":3,"why":"Cara mencari situs lewat Google ('cari di google resmi lapak ...') dipakai agar situs judi sulit dilacak lewat tautan.","any_of":["\\b(?:cari|cr|ketik)\\s+(?:di|d)\\s+google\\b[^.\\n]{0,25}\\b(?:resmi|lapak|situs|link|agen)\\b","\\blapak ?\\d{2,3}\\b"]},
{"id":"J13","tactic":"TAUTAN MENCURIGAKAN","weight":3,"why":"Nama domain memuat istilah atau angka khas situs judi online (misalnya gacor, maxwin, atau 777).","any_of":["\\b[a-z0-9-]*(?:slot|gacor|maxwin|togel|judi|casino|jepe|wede|wde|scatter|[a-z](?:77|88|138|168|188|303|777|888|999|4d))[a-z0-9-]*\\.(?:org|com|net|xyz|top|click|icu|site|online|vip|cc|club|win|bet|live|fun|asia|id|co|me|pro|info|biz|link|store|shop|app|la|st|ly|run)\\b","\\bw[e3]d[e3]+h*[a-z0-9-]*\\.(?:shop|store|live|site|online|xyz|top|click|icu|vip|cc|club|win|bet|fun|asia|link)\\b"]},
{"id":"J14","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":3,"why":"Istilah promosi situs judi seperti 'RTP slot', 'bonus new member', atau 'depo via pulsa'. Judi online ilegal di Indonesia dan sering dipakai untuk menjebak korban agar terus menyetor.","any_of":["\\b(?:rtp|bocoran|pola)\\s+(?:slot|gacor|hari ini|live)\\b","\\bslot\\s+(?:gacor|online|thailand|server|pragmatic|pg)\\b","\\b(?:situs|agen|bandar)\\s+(?:slot|togel|judi|casino|kasino|bola|poker|sbobet)\\b","\\bdepo(?:sit)?\\s+(?:via\\s+)?(?:pulsa|dana|ovo|gopay|qris|linkaja)\\b","\\bbonus\\s+(?:new\\s*member|member\\s+baru|depo(?:sit)?|rollingan|referral)\\b","\\bbonus\\s+\\d+\\s?%","\\b(?:turnover|rollingan|winrate)\\b"]},
{"id":"J15","tactic":"JUDI ONLINE","weight":2,"why":"Sapaan 'bosku' yang dipakai bersama ajakan depo, slot, atau menang adalah gaya khas pesan massal situs judi.","any_of":["\\bbo?ss?ku+h?\\b","\\bbo?ss?\\s*ku\\b"],"also_requires":["depo","slot","gacor","wede","\\bjp\\b","menang","modal","bonus","cuan","maxwin","scatter","mahjong","\\bwd\\b","daftar"]},
{"id":"N01","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":4,"why":"Pesan mengaku ada dana atau deposit yang 'sudah masuk' sambil menyertakan tautan. Ini umpan agar kamu membuka tautan dan akhirnya menyetor uang atau memberi data. Cek saldo lewat aplikasi resmi, bukan tautan.","any_of":["(?:deposit|saldo|dana|uang|hadiah|bonus|dompet)[^\\n]{0,40}\\b(?:telah|sudah|udah|sdh)\\s+(?:berhasil\\s+)?(?:di)?(?:kredit|transfer|kirim|tambah|masuk)","\\b(?:telah|sudah|udah|sdh)\\s+(?:berhasil\\s+)?(?:di)?(?:kredit|transfer|kirim)\\w*\\s+ke\\s+(?:akun|rekening|dompet|wallet|saldo)","(?:rp\\.? ?\\d[\\d.,]*|\\d+(?:[.,]\\d+)? ?(?:juta|jt|ribu|rb|k))\\s+(?:anda\\s+|kamu\\s+)?(?:telah|sudah|udah|sdh|baru)\\s+(?:di)?(?:transfer|kirim|kredit|cair|masuk|tambah)\\w*"],"also_requires":["https?://|\\bwww\\.|\\b[a-z0-9-]+\\.[a-z]{2,}/\\S"]},
{"id":"N02","tactic":"URGENSI","weight":3,"why":"Batas waktu verifikasi yang sangat singkat dipakai agar kamu tidak sempat berpikir.","any_of":["\\bverifikasi\\b[^.\\n]{0,10}\\b(?:maks\\w*|max\\w*|dalam|paling lama|batas)\\s*\\d+\\s*(?:jam|menit|hari)"]},
