{"id":"N04","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":2,"why":"Diminta memeriksa saldo lewat tautan di pesan. Cek saldo hanya lewat aplikasi resmi yang kamu pasang sendiri.","any_of":["(?:periksa|cek|lihat)\\w*\\s+(?:saldo|dana|rekening|akun)\\b"],"also_requires":["https?://|\\bwww\\.|\\b[a-z0-9-]+\\.[a-z]{2,}/\\S"]},
