{"id":"N09","tactic":"TAUTAN MENCURIGAKAN","weight":2,"why":"Pesan mengajak kamu membuka tautan. Jangan klik tautan dari pesan yang tidak kamu minta. Buka situs atau aplikasi resminya sendiri.","any_of":["\\b(?:klik|tekan|ketuk|tap|buka|akses|kunjungi)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,2}(?:link|lnk|tautan|tombol|url|situs)\\b","\\b(?:melalui|lewat|via|pada|di)\\s+(?:link|tautan)\\s+(?:berikut|dibawah|di bawah|ini)\\b","\\b(?:link|tautan)\\s+(?:berikut|dibawah|di bawah)\\b","\\b(?:cek|periksa|lihat|ambil|klaim|claim|daftar|verifikasi)\\w*\\s+(?:disini|di sini|di link|di tautan|lewat link|lewat tautan)\\b","\\bklik\\s+(?:disini|di sini|untuk|saja|aja)\\b","\\bsilahkan\\s+(?:klik|cek|buka)\\b","\\bkl(?:em|ek|iq)\\s+(?:disini|di sini|link|tautan)\\b"],"also_requires":["https?://|\\bwww\\.|\\b[a-z0-9-]+\\.[a-z]{2,}/\\S"]},
{"id":"N10","tactic":"IMING-IMING","weight":3,"why":"Pesan massal yang bilang ada hadiah atau bonus khusus untukmu dan mengajak membuka tautan. Hadiah yang tidak pernah kamu ikuti hampir pasti umpan.","any_of":["\\b(?:ada|dapat|dapatkan|dpt|ini|berikut)\\s+(?:hadiah|bonus|reward|voucher|undian|kejutan|promo)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,2}(?:untuk|buat|khusus|bagi)\\s+(?:kamu|anda|kakak|kak|kk|mu|member|pelanggan)\\b","\\b(?:hadiah|bonus|reward)\\s+(?:spesial|eksklusif|istimewa|gede|besar|jutaan)\\b","\\bakun\\s+(?:anda|kamu)\\s+(?:mendapat\\w*|dapat|memperoleh|menerima)\\s+(?:hadiah|bonus|reward|saldo|poin)\\b"],"also_requires":["https?://|\\bwww\\.|\\b[a-z0-9-]+\\.[a-z]{2,}/\\S","\\bklik\\b","\\blink\\b","\\bdaftar\\b","\\bklaim\\b","\\bjoin\\b","\\bverifikasi\\b"]},
{"id":"N11","tactic":"DATA RAHASIA","weight":2,"why":"Diminta memperbarui atau memverifikasi data akun lewat tautan adalah pola phishing yang umum. Lakukan hanya lewat aplikasi resmi yang kamu pasang sendiri.","any_of":["\\b(?:perbarui|update|perbaharui|lengkapi|konfirmasi|verifikasi|validasi)\\w*\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,2}(?:data|informasi|info|akun|identitas|rekening|profil)\\b"],"also_requires":["https?://","\\bklik\\b","\\blink\\b","\\btautan\\b","\\bwww\\.","\\b[a-z0-9-]+\\.[a-z]{2,}/\\S"],"unless":["jangan\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,2}\\w*$","(?:tidak|tak)\\s+(?:pernah|akan)\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,4}\\w*$"]},
{"id":"N12","tactic":"URGENSI","weight":2,"why":"Batas waktu yang sangat singkat, 'hangus', atau 'kesempatan terakhir' dipakai agar kamu tidak sempat berpikir atau bertanya ke orang lain.","any_of":["\\b(?:dalam|maksimal|maks|paling lambat|batas(?: waktu)?|selama)\\s+\\d+\\s*(?:jam|menit)\\b","\\bsebelum\\s+(?:jam|pukul)\\s+\\d","\\bsebelum\\s+(?:waktu|masa|batas)\\w*\\s+(?:\\w+\\s+){0,2}(?:berakhir|habis|hangus)","\\bhangus\\b","\\bmasa\\s+klaim\\b","\\bkesempatan\\s+terakhir\\b","\\btinggal\\s+(?:sebentar|sedikit|\\d+\\s+(?:jam|menit|hari))\\s*(?:lagi)?\\b","\\bjangan\\s+sampai\\s+(?:menyesal|kehabisan|kelewat\\w*|ketinggalan|terlambat|terlewat)\\b"],"also_requires":["verifikasi","klaim","claim","akun","bonus","hadiah","saldo","diblokir","dinonaktifkan","promo","gratis","undian","rekening","withdraw","\\bwd\\b","depo"]},
